title: End of the Railway Strike
new-page: true
view-if: vikzhel_strike == 1 and (coalition_government >= 1 or vikzhel_unrest < 10)
tags: event
on-arrival: {!
    Q.vikzhel_strike_ended = 1;
    Q.vikzhel_strike = 0;
    Q.workers_unrest -= 10;
    Q.railroad_strike_seen = 0; 

    Q.military_trains = Math.max(Q.military_trains, Q.previous_military_trains);

    window.indShock('rail_strike', 0);
    window.indShock('rail_strike_yards', 0);
    window.indDisrupt('all', 'all', 0.1, 3);
!}

= Railroad Strike Ends

Satisfied by our recent efforts, Vikzhel has announced that they are lifting their strike, bringing the railways back to working order. 
 
